n><span>buổi</span></span><span><span> Semina.</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"assets/news/1058/23857a9621.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /> <img src=\"assets/news/1058/9a1b02e33f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /> <img src=\"assets/news/1058/6ac9241d0c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /></p>","he":"<p><span>Friday afternoon, 18 April 2025, in Room B201, the Department of Mathematics held its regular April 2025 seminar. The talks presented at the seminar were:</span></p>\n<p><span>Talk 1. The Dijkstra algorithm for solving the transportation problem, presented by Dr. Nguyễn Văn Minh.</span></p>\n<p><span>Talk 2. Several factors contribute to misallocation in the textile industry, presented by MSc. PhD candidate Nguyễn Hữu Thịnh</span></p>\n<p><span>The seminar created a lively and useful atmosphere of academic exchange, helping the lecturers of the Department of Mathematics further clarify many ways of applying mathematical methods in economics, business, and banking and finance to solve real-world problems. Below are some photos of the seminar.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"assets/news/1058/23857a9621.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /> <img src=\"assets/news/1058/9a1b02e33f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /> <img src=\"assets/news/1058/6ac9241d0c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" /></p>","imgs":["assets/news/1058/23857a9621.jpeg","assets/news/1058/9a1b02e33f.jpeg","assets/news/1058/6ac9241d0c.jpeg"]}